variable C31 equal 0.5*(158879.077011813+${C3pos})
variable C31 equal 0.5*(158879.077011813+-158538.619010441)
variable C4${dir} equal 0.5*(${C4neg}+${C4pos})
variable C41 equal 0.5*(${C4neg}+${C4pos})
variable C41 equal 0.5*(76.543762487326+${C4pos})
variable C41 equal 0.5*(76.543762487326+-76.567044615917)
variable C5${dir} equal 0.5*(${C5neg}+${C5pos})
variable C51 equal 0.5*(${C5neg}+${C5pos})
variable C51 equal 0.5*(-106.500076294779+${C5pos})
variable C51 equal 0.5*(-106.500076294779+106.488355999203)
